(98, 1, '2025-02-18 01:56:56', '2025-02-18 00:56:56', '<h1>Qui sommes-nous ?</h1>				\n		<p>Nous sommes une entreprise proposant la vente de kits de plantes à faire pousser, des graines, etc. Notre démarche rentre dans le cadre du jardinage écologique et soucieux de l\'environnement.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/a-propos\">\n									À propos\n					</a>\n					<h1>La vie des plantes</h1>				\n					<h2>Kits de plantes en pots, accessoires</h2>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/shop\">\n									Boutique\n					</a>\n					<h1>Nos produits</h1>				\n                    <ul>\n                                                                    <li><a href=\"#woolentortab8e61efb1\">\n                                                Petits pots                                            </a></li>\n                                                            </ul>\n                                            <a href=\"http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/product/radis-et-capucine-trefle/\">\n                                                <img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-300x300.png 300w, http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-150x150.png 150w, http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-768x768.png 768w, http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-600x600.png 600w, http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle-100x100.png 100w, http://localhost/la_vie_des_plantes/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/capucine_et_trefle.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\